
  {{.Node.Name}}: login node of the Flapjack lab. Homes are shared from
  the head over NFS ({{index .Node.Labels "head"}}:/c/home); every compute node
  sees the same /c/home.

    sinfo                                 the cluster
    sbatch --wrap 'hostname > out.$SLURM_JOB_ID'; squeue
    srun -N2 --chdir ~ pwd                jobs start in your home, on any node
    ls ~/                                 your job output, written by the nodes

